   ['Writing objectives that do not match the evaluation.', 'Leaving no time for learner activity.', 'Skipping the link to previous knowledge.', 'Plans whose timings do not add up.'],
   'Head teachers and inspectors in many systems check lesson notes and schemes of work as part of supervision.',
