   ['Assuming lecture is always bad.', 'Running group work without roles or a clear task.', 'Asking only recall questions.', 'Giving no wait time.'],
   'Think-pair-share costs nothing and works in very large classes, which is why teacher-training programmes in many countries promote it.',
